catflow 0.8
1. Read Index             library.index
2. Human Input            "Your question:"; wait=forever; ctx+
3. Rewrite                Ministral 3B; "Make the question standalone,
                          resolving references to the conversation"; ctx
4. Embed                  BGE-M3
5. Retrieve       (1,4)   top_k=5
6. Template       (5,3)   "Context:\n{1}\n\nQ: {2}"
7. Answer                 Qwen3 8B; ctx; ctx+
8. Ask Human              "Another question?"; wait=forever; tags: ask, done
   -> { ask: 2 | done: 9 }
9. Save Context           session.ctx
